  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "The tail domain binds to the cytoplasmic domain of both integrin beta-1a and beta-1d isoforms. The presence of Ca(2+) ions does not prevent binding of a fragment consisting of the second cysteine rich repeat and the tail domain but prevents the binding of the full-length protein"
